This step will automatically configure your Nginx installation to use the SSL certificate and enable HTTPS for your domain.

4. Update the Nginx configuration file to reverse proxy traffic to your Nakama instance. Edit the `/etc/nginx/sites-available/default` file and replace its content with the following:

```
server {
    listen 80 default_server;
    listen [::]:80 default_server;
    server_name streetcore.store;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://localhost:7350;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
        proxy_set_header Connection "upgrade";
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
    }   
}
```
5. Restart Nginx for changes to take effect:
