To achieve (2), when you perform the Renderer's shutdown, make sure you are properly cleaning up the graphics pipeline by calling the `Shutdown()` or `Cleanup()` function of your Pipeline object. Also, make sure that the cleanup function is idempotent, meaning that it can be called more than once without any side effects:

