Adjust the code depending on your specific needs, like the number of uniform buffers or combined image samplers you'll allocate from the descriptor pool.

Also, please note that it's not efficient to call CreateDescriptorSet() inside the Render() function. Instead, you should create descriptor sets when initializing the material and update them when needed, not every render call.

